IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPARQ-PRUNING.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOP-K               PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SKIPPED-TOKENS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPARSITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100  PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPARQ.
    IF SEQ-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF TOP-K <= 0
        COMPUTE TOP-K = SEQ-LEN / 4.
    END-IF.
    IF TOP-K == 0
        MOVE 1 TO TOP-K.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE SKIPPED-TOKENS = SEQ-LEN - TOP-K.
    COMPUTE SPARSITY-PCT = (SKIPPED-TOKENS * 100) / SEQ-LEN.
    COMPUTE SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100 = 100 + (SPARSITY-PCT * 125 / 100).

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100.
    WEIGHT 30 TOP-K.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
